G-COCONUT-LIFT-PROXY — Coconut continuous-thought recipe, small-scale de-risk (GPT-2 124M)
date: 2026-07-09
verdict: PASS (GREEN)   [pre-registered gate met with a large margin]
paper: Coconut / "Training LLMs to Reason in a Continuous Latent Space" (arXiv 2412.06769)
purpose: de-risk a later 12B bake — does latent continuous-thought (n>0) beat no-CoT (n=0)
         on a held-out multi-hop task by a pre-registered margin, at small scale?

=================================================================================
PRE-REGISTERED GATE
  PASS iff  coconut(N>0) OOD acc − NoCoT-model OOD acc >= +15 pts (absolute)
       AND  coconut(N>0) OOD acc >= 60%.
  Null baseline = the SEPARATELY-TRAINED NoCoT model (question->answer, no thoughts).
=================================================================================

=== 1. DATASET (synthetic multi-hop path-reasoning, ProsQA-style, compositional-OOD) ===
  seed=13 (deterministic), K=4 hops, 300 nodes, 4 relations, 3 decoy nodes/example.
  Query = start node + program of 4 relations; answer = terminal node after following
  the program over a random relation graph (facts shuffled, distractors included).
  A no-reasoning model must compose 4 sequential branch-lookups in ONE forward -> fails.
  Compositional-OOD split: a "composition" = adjacent traversed edge-pair
  (junction_pred, r_in, r_out). Held out 720/4800 composition triples. Every EDGE (node,rel)
  still appears in train (coverage pass: 1200/1200 edges covered, 0 augment needed);
  every val_ood query traverses >=1 held-out composition (the COMBINATION is never seen).
  Sizes:  train=12000  val_id=1500  val_ood=1500   (val_ood is the headline)
  Repro:  COCONUT_SEED=13 COCONUT_N_TRAIN=12000 COCONUT_N_VAL_ID=1500 COCONUT_N_VAL_OOD=1500 \
          python gen_data.py    (pure-python, no deps; identical bytes each run)

=== 2. LOCAL CPU SMOKE (de-risk before GPU) ===
  Tiny config (40 nodes, 80/86 train ex, 1 stage/epoch), modes=nocot,coco:1, CPU.
  (a) latent feedback loop runs (no shape/dtype errors) — OK
  (b) training loss decreases — nocot 22.9->7.55 (1 epoch), coco:1 curriculum ->1.63 — OK
  (c) eval runs, emits accuracy for both arms (0.0 at 86-ex scale = expected undertrained) — OK
  Repro:  bash run_smoke.sh   (artifacts in models_smoke/)

=== 3. GPU RUN ===
  lane: Colab G4 (colab CLI in WSL, acct nihilistcod) -> NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell.
        (HF Jobs lane was BLOCKED: HTTP 402 "insufficient pre-paid credit balance".)
  base: GPT-2 (124M), full finetune. special tokens <bot><eot><latent><ans>.
  train config: BASELINE=4 ep, curriculum stages 0..4 (STAGE=1 ep, FINAL_EXTRA=2 ep),
                batch=32, lr=1e-4, thoughts-per-step c=1, N_eval = c*K = 4 latent thoughts.
  method (faithful to paper): latent slot input-embed = previous position's post-ln_f last
                hidden state (manual multi-forward, KV reuse); loss masks question+latent
                positions; optimizer reset per stage; 0.3 mix of earlier stages.
  wall: pass A (nocot,cot,coco:1) train+eval ~17 min, uploaded before the session dropped.

  HEADLINE — OOD accuracy (val_ood, 1500 ex, greedy):
    arm                         OOD acc     ID acc
    NoCoT (n=0, the null)        7.13%       8.60%
    Coconut c=1, N=4 thoughts   69.87%      75.33%     <-- the recipe
    Full-CoT (ceiling)          89.60%      90.13%
    [coco c=1 self-ablation N=0: OOD 67.87%  ->  thoughts ON vs OFF = +2.0 pts]

=== 4. GATE VERDICT: PASS (GREEN) ===
    lift  = coconut(N>0) OOD − NoCoT OOD = 69.87% − 7.13% = +62.73 pts   (>= +15 required)  PASS
    floor = coconut(N>0) OOD = 69.87%                                    (>= 60% required)   PASS
    => G-COCONUT-LIFT-PROXY = GREEN.  Recipe works at small scale; 12B bake is de-risked.

  HONEST CAVEAT (load-bearing for the 12B decision):
    The huge lift is measured vs the NoCoT MODEL (the pre-registered null) and is decisive.
    BUT the same coconut model with thoughts turned OFF at inference already scores 67.87% OOD
    (self-ablation lift only +2.0 pts). => Most of the OOD gain comes from the CURRICULUM
    TRAINING PROCEDURE (staged internalization of reasoning), not from test-time latent compute.
    For the 12B bake this means: the Coconut *training curriculum* is the high-value component;
    do not expect large marginal gains from adding latent thoughts at inference on top of it.

=== 5. DETERMINISM (greedy eval reproducible) ===
    verdict: PASS.
    Empirical: coco_c1 (with the N=4 latent-thought forward loop) evaluated TWICE on identical
    weights -> BIT-IDENTICAL prediction vectors (full argmax vectors compared, not just accuracy).
    By construction: eval is temperature-0 argmax (answer-position argmax for nocot/coco;
    token-by-token greedy for cot) with no sampling -> a deterministic function of (weights,inputs).
    Also: the seeded pipeline reproduced bit-identically at init across independent GPU sessions
    (nocot step-1 loss 22.9088 and cot step-1 loss 16.2427 identical in sessions 1/2/3).
    Repro:  python det2.py   (loads models_smoke/coco_c1, evals x2, compares predictions)

