=== 7. BLOCKER / NOT-COMPLETED (honest) ===
    c=2 arm NOT completed. c=2's coco:2 leg (up to 8 latents = 9 sequential forwards/step) plus
    eval finishes at ~32-40 min; Colab G4 sessions were repeatedly torn down at ~30-40 min
    (runtime limit), before that leg could eval+upload. Attempted 3 sessions (cocoproxy2/3/4);
    the 4th used strict HF-only polling (no session interference) and still dropped -> confirms a
    Colab runtime cap, not a polling artifact. Pass A (c=1) survived only because its A/B split
    uploaded the gate at ~17 min. Compute cap (~2 GPU-hours) reached; no 5th session launched;
    all Colab sessions stopped/terminated. c=1 result is decisive, so the gate verdict stands.
    HF Jobs lane unusable until the account has a positive credit balance (402 Payment Required).

REGISTRATION: none (proxy only). This gates whether the 12B Coconut bake is worth it -> YES for
the training curriculum; treat inference-time latent thoughts as low marginal value (see caveat).
